Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙海盗哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.39,0:01:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第十话 纹身的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精神感应枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.53,0:01:52.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精神感应枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:04.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法，手竟然自己动了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个打倒了水晶人的哥普拉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.49,0:02:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来事情真是不太妙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是会给主人找麻烦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:19.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个男人就是哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和多明尼克一起死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱住我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就能拖延些时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉为何要救我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.39,0:03:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开关被破坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.96,0:03:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发布进入紧急状态的通告！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以让他们两个活着离开基地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.09,0:03:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身为海盗的你为什么要救身为银河警察的我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.79,0:03:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不忍看到你那可爱的屁股被机械狗咬掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:58.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那并不是真正的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:03:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底为何要救我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.49,0:04:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是多明尼克吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.69,0:04:04.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么知道我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是珍告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你见过简了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错，还有凯萨琳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:11.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯萨琳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在她们两个在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事以后再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:24.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，你会滑雪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滑雪？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,岂止会我要是参加奥运会的话，金牌就是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心，这是喷射滑雪器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时速能高达300公里每小时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一定很刺激的了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,调校到最高速度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.73,0:05:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们是脱离成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追兵马上就到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.83,0:05:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心有人工暴风雪掩护我们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:32.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距离480米
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:35.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正向东北方前进中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吗？哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:50.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追兵来了吗，真快
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以小看雪哥利亚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞄得真准
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们的枪装有热能感应器
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:09.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是缠人的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:27.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.66,0:06:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,队长，哥普拉在这雪中好像也能看见我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开枪！开枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要让他们逃掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我能感应她们的话，就算看不到照样也能打中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们现在一定吓得不敢动了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:06.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:07.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.93,0:07:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你没事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过那家伙真固执
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你说应该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看还是只有逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，那边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啊，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有冰裂缝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那正是我们逃命的好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:51.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖跟上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:08:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那两个白痴居然选了条绝路走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克以旗子为起点飞过去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.43,0:08:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喷射滑雪器的速度无法飞过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:26.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你想被她们射成全身开遍红花吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去了，多明尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:11.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到她们自寻死路 省了我一番功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.41,0:09:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了不被打成马蜂窝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然选择永远埋入谷底之路
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为能打败水晶人的人\N一定是个非常厉害的人物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.24,0:09:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过尔尔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收队！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:19.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然把宇宙船藏在这种地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克就由我带走了 再见吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:11:00.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经脱离鲁鲁斯星的引力圈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.64,0:11:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你边查得怎么样了，哥普拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:07.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是认为查得非常彻底了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是全宇宙最美丽的屁股了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知不觉看呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌，你有认真的在查吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.11,0:11:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正在小心地调查中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那，有没有查出什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.21,0:11:37.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你们三姊妹的纹身输入电脑后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该可以解开其中的秘密的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:41.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等！哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了我们的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就告诉我两位妹妹在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:59.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍，凯萨琳与我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,20年来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:07.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从未有见彼此一面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说我们是亲姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是很奇怪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯萨琳也说了同样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说的话 我很快就可以和她们见面了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.01,0:12:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.94,0:12:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍和凯萨琳现在在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.81,0:12:30.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说她们…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.61,0:12:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们已经不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:12:59.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍和凯萨琳，到了最后\N还是被基尔顿的海盗杀死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯萨琳！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯萨琳和我的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.14,0:14:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会到多明尼克的姐姐那里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:24.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要为妹妹她们报仇的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:27.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要消灭基尔顿！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我看看解析内尔森船长的宝藏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:15.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想请我听音乐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:18.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的嗜好很高尚吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:25.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是能解开纹身之谜的最先进的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯，今天调子不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么现在就开始大演奏会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了，开始解析吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:54.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍的纹身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着是凯萨琳的纹身
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:06.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后是多明尼克你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.11,0:16:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果将你们三姐妹的纹身重叠在一起的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！黑成一片，什么也看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:41.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来以为三个纹身重叠的话 就会出现地图的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:48.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前方二万公里处发现敌人的电波反应
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:16:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连最先进的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:01.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也解不开纹身之谜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.01,0:17:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太难了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.98,0:17:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那尼尔森的宝藏怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还未完全失败的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了，还有这个方法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.61,0:17:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快来试试
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.61,0:17:19.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光的三原色，红绿蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如适当混入这三原色的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.18,0:17:30.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论什么色彩都可以调出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.01,0:17:39.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.21,0:17:45.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说把那些纹身独自上色的话\N把它们再次重叠就会成为一张彩色照片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:46.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:49.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三人三色
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,详细的组合就交由电脑去选
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个纹身透过选色镜着色
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:58.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍是红色
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯萨琳是绿色
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而多明尼克你是蓝色
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.41,0:18:09.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将这些组合合而为一的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:25.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好完美的地图！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上半部分显示了行星的坐标
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下半部分则显示了宝藏所在的经度和纬度
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:33.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个星球在那里？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砂之星 萨德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.91,0:18:50.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基尔顿舰队接近中！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌舰约五十艘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，现在该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.31,0:18:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基尔顿这么快就来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全速甩掉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:19:00.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去萨德斯惑星
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:02.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.58,0:19:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.78,0:19:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是古代宇宙文！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.61,0:19:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现到宇宙最终兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:19.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把它放在金字塔里面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留给我的三个女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内尔森船长
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终兵器？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:36.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到的不是财宝 居然是最终兵器！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.91,0:19:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，什么是最终兵器！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是古代火星人制造的兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.21,0:19:44.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说完成后它还把制造人杀了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:48.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可说是宇宙有史以来的最强兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙史上最强
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.61,0:19:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去一直被认为这不过是个传说而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到它真的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂 Formation C.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入超高速空间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能量输出0.7
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,局部重力正常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱离超高速空间
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:31.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.01,0:21:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.51,0:21:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.51,0:21:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直就是GAS的集合体
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是照计算看来，那里就是萨德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.54,0:21:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，瑞蒂，突进！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.11,0:21:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终兵器！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.61,0:21:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管财宝有多庞大 那只是一个海盗掠夺来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基尔顿根本就不会看得上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:21:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能吸引他们的果然只有最终兵器了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.04,0:22:27.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终兵器吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍和凯萨琳都为了它而死了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:35.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要亲手找到到，粉碎了它！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.51,0:22:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了寻找最终兵器而来到了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.68,0:22:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于来到了砂之惑星萨德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道事情不会那么顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.19,0:22:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还有更缠人的厉害的家伙珊德拉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.69,0:22:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是一个不肯让人的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.59,0:22:56.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在墓室中也激战
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.76,0:22:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,助手也帮了很大的忙哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还出现了奇怪的守卫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一集\N砂之惑星 萨德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.93,0:23:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
